  "body_html": "<p><strong>Paid subscribers:</strong> jump to the trade alert <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/175431026/trade-alert\">here</a>.</p><p>Hello fellow Sharks,</p><p>Telco is my home turf. It was the first core sector I covered when I started in the capital markets, and I’ve loved it ever since.</p><p>Today I’m flagging a new move in an emerging-markets telco I’ve been tracking. The stock is already a 6x multibagger off the lows, but I still see room for at least another double from here. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PV76!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa635ecb5-867d-4b47-9150-938756498a92_728x535.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PV76!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa635ecb5-867d-4b47-9150-938756498a92_728x535.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PV76!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa635ecb5-867d-4b47-9150-938756498a92_728x535.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PV76!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa635ecb5-867d-4b47-9150-938756498a92_728x535.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PV76!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa635ecb5-867d-4b47-9150-938756498a92_728x535.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PV76!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/http